  "response": {
    "text": "## Archive Purge Procedure: `ledger-archive-legacy`\n\n**Scope:** This procedure removes expired ledger exports. It does not affect active ledger snapshots.\n\n**WARNING:** The deletion command permanently destroys bucket `ledger-archive-legacy`. After deletion, recovery requires restoring from cold storage.\n\n### Before you run the deletion command\n\nConfirm both conditions:\n\n1. Export `export-2027-02-18` is complete.\n2. Change ticket `OPS-6634` carries approval.\n\n### Run the deletion command\n\nOnce both conditions are satisfied, run:\n\n```bash\nvaultctl delete bucket ledger-archive-legacy --confirm\n```\n\n### Verify the result\n\nRun:\n\n```bash\nvaultctl describe bucket ledger-archive-legacy\n```\n\nConfirm the output reflects the deletion.",
